{"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Tracking","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-7fax9","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-24yuc"],"title":"Tracking"},{"anchor":"Sampling","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/InvalidSampleRate"],"title":"Sampling"},{"anchor":"Consent","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/NegativeHeldRecordLimit"],"title":"Consent"},{"anchor":"Reports","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport"],"title":"Reports"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" is a value. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},{"type":"text","text":" only queues the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, from any thread. A worker the tracker owns, never on the main actor, does the rest in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order events were tracked: it makes the event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord"},{"type":"text","text":", checks its constraints, runs the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enrichers ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"type":"text","text":") on the context it was tracked in, applies the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"type":"text","text":"s and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"},{"type":"text","text":", writes the record to the tracker’s store if it has one, and publishes it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"type":"text","text":" waits for the worker to catch up; "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" does too, then ends the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build one tracker where the app starts. Pass it down, or bind it to a task with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/withTracker(_:_:)-7fax9","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and read it anywhere inside with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". With nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bound, as in a detached task, it drops every event like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and logs a warning for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first one at each call site, so hand such a task a tracker value. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gives a copy that adds to the context of the events tracked through it alone, for code a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task-local context doesn’t reach. To enrich only what one destination receives, apply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enriched(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to that destination instead (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destinations"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker reports every event it drops: one that breaks a declared constraint on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","type":"reference"},{"text":", one a sampler leaves out on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference"},{"text":", and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a consent drops on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delivering a tracker’s records to destinations is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deliver(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":" in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destinations"},{"type":"text","text":" module, and keeping them on disk is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Persistence"},{"type":"text","text":". For a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"test that checks what its code tracked, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wit